# Rust
/target/
# Cargo.lock is committed (not ignored): this workspace ships a binary (faucet-cli),
# and CI re-resolving fresh can pull broken upstream releases (e.g. the aws-smithy /
# aws-runtime 1.7.4 break, #234) that red main and every PR. Committing the lock gives
# reproducible builds. Run `cargo update` deliberately to take new deps.

